      "title": "Street Cart-Style Chicken Bowls",
      "description": "Rice bowl with golden spiced chicken, green zucchini, cucumber-tomato salad, lime crema and cilantro",
      "servings": "2 servings",
      "totalTime": "PT30M",
      "ingredients": [
        "1 cup jasmine rice",
        "12 oz boneless skinless chicken, bite-size pieces",
        "2 medium zucchini, sliced",
        "1 small cucumber, diced",
        "1 medium tomato, diced",
        "2 Tbsp sour cream",
        "1 lime",
        "2 Tbsp chopped cilantro",
        "1 tsp cumin",
        "1 tsp paprika",
        "1 Tbsp olive oil",
        "Salt & black pepper"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "Cook 1 cup rice according to package directions. Keep covered when done.",
        "Toss cucumber, tomato, half the cilantro, juice from half the lime, and a pinch of salt. Set aside.",
        "Season chicken with cumin, paprika, salt, and pepper. Heat 1 Tbsp olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
        "Cook chicken until browned and cooked through, about 6–8 minutes. Transfer to a plate.",
        "Add zucchini to the same skillet and cook until browned-tender, about 5–6 minutes. Season lightly.",
        "Stir sour cream with remaining lime juice and 1–2 tsp water until drizzleable.",
        "Divide rice between bowls. Add chicken, zucchini, cucumber-tomato salad, sauce, and remaining cilantro."
      ],
